[1.28, "o", "\r\n"]
[1.43, "o", "\r\n"]
[1.431, "o", "\u001b[1m==> 1. The target is the local kind cluster\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.561, "o", "  \u001b[32mPASS\u001b[0m  API server is local: https://127.0.0.1:34923\r\n"]
[1.562, "o", "\r\n"]
[1.563, "o", "\u001b[1m==> 2. The webhook is deployed and serving\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.922, "o", "  \u001b[32mPASS\u001b[0m  1 replica(s) ready\r\n"]
[2.045, "o", "  \u001b[32mPASS\u001b[0m  caBundle injected by cert-manager\r\n"]
[2.285, "o", "  \u001b[32mPASS\u001b[0m  failurePolicy=Ignore, timeoutSeconds=5\r\n"]
[2.402, "o", "  \u001b[32mPASS\u001b[0m  kube-system and provenance-gate-system are excluded from the webhook\r\n"]
[2.521, "o", "  \u001b[32mPASS\u001b[0m  the webhook governs only namespaces labelled provenance.miportfolio.com/enforce=true\r\n"]
[2.523, "o", "\r\n"]
[2.523, "o", "\u001b[1m==> 3. The subjects exist in the registry\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[4.86, "o", "  \u001b[32mPASS\u001b[0m  signed   ghcr.io/mampiz/provenance-gate@sha256:dab072be...d0f866fd\r\n"]
[4.867, "o", "  \u001b[32mPASS\u001b[0m  unsigned ghcr.io/mampiz/provenance-gate-unsigned@sha256:b8f49107...598f59b0\r\n"]
[4.87, "o", "  \u001b[32mPASS\u001b[0m  decoy    ghcr.io/mampiz/provenance-gate-decoy@sha256:8da452da...820516ad\r\n"]
[4.873, "o", "\r\n"]
[4.875, "o", "\u001b[1m==> 4. A trust root that names this repository's release workflow\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[5.412, "o", "  \u001b[32mPASS\u001b[0m  BuildIdentity provenance-gate-e2e/e2e is Ready\r\n"]
[5.413, "o", "\r\n"]
[5.414, "o", "\u001b[1m==> 5. CASE 2: an image with no attestation is REJECTED\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[5.563, "o", "  \u001b[32mPASS\u001b[0m  rejected: 85f0f5bcb63126ea5b9123b1ec30982598f59b0\" is refused by BuildIdentity provenance-gate-\u2026\r\n"]
[5.564, "o", "\r\n"]
[5.565, "o", "\u001b[1m==> 6. CASE 3: an image signed by another legitimate workflow is REJECTED\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[6.418, "o", "  \u001b[32mPASS\u001b[0m  rejected: 9fa1039e102428b22bb3768ca55ad820516ad satisfies this workload's build identity: image\u2026\r\n"]
[6.419, "o", "\r\n"]
[6.42, "o", "\u001b[1m==> 7. CASE 1: the image built by the named workflow is ADMITTED\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[6.578, "o", "  \u001b[32mPASS\u001b[0m  admitted\r\n"]
[6.579, "o", "\r\n"]
[6.581, "o", "\u001b[1m==> 8. A workload with no trust root is REJECTED\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[6.768, "o", "  \u001b[32mPASS\u001b[0m  rejected: no trust root governs it\r\n"]
[6.769, "o", "\r\n"]
[6.77, "o", "\u001b[32m F3 VERIFIER PASSED \u001b[0m\r\n"]
[6.771, "o", "  admitted  ghcr.io/mampiz/provenance-gate\r\n"]
[6.772, "o", "  rejected  ghcr.io/mampiz/provenance-gate-unsigned (no attestation)\r\n"]
[6.773, "o", "  rejected  ghcr.io/mampiz/provenance-gate-decoy (built by another workflow)\r\n"]
[6.773, "o", "\r\n"]
